1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,830
Your wrist has forty-one strings tied

2
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:05,406
to it this morning.

3
00:00:05,426 --> 00:00:07,376
And one of them just snapped.

4
00:00:07,665 --> 00:00:09,635
In this world, every promise you make

5
00:00:09,655 --> 00:00:11,093
becomes a string.

6
00:00:11,113 --> 00:00:13,118
Keep it, and it turns gold and fades

7
00:00:13,138 --> 00:00:14,058
away.

8
00:00:14,078 --> 00:00:15,808
Break it, and it snaps.

9
00:00:15,828 --> 00:00:17,132
Everybody hears it.

10
00:00:19,082 --> 00:00:20,962
You promise your boss the report by

11
00:00:20,982 --> 00:00:22,041
Friday.

12
00:00:22,061 --> 00:00:24,456
You promise Theo you'll fix his bike.

13
00:00:24,476 --> 00:00:25,861
Mira texts.

14
00:00:25,881 --> 00:00:27,945
She's moving flats on Sunday.

15
00:00:27,965 --> 00:00:29,236
You promise to help.

16
00:00:29,256 --> 00:00:30,236
And Mum.

17
00:00:30,256 --> 00:00:32,761
You promised Mum you'd visit on Sunday.

18
00:00:32,781 --> 00:00:34,100
Three weeks ago.

19
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,651
That one's the thickest.

20
00:00:35,671 --> 00:00:38,067
It hums when you walk past her photo.

21
00:00:39,717 --> 00:00:41,957
Friday, the report string snaps.

22
00:00:41,977 --> 00:00:43,972
Your boss doesn't even look up.

23
00:00:43,992 --> 00:00:46,622
Saturday, Theo's bike string snaps.

24
00:00:46,642 --> 00:00:48,667
He looks up for a long time.

25
00:00:48,857 --> 00:00:50,376
Then Sunday comes.

26
00:00:50,396 --> 00:00:51,386
Two strings.

27
00:00:51,406 --> 00:00:53,427
Pulling in opposite directions.

28
00:00:53,447 --> 00:00:55,152
Mum's house is east.

29
00:00:55,172 --> 00:00:56,892
Mira's flat is west.

30
00:00:56,912 --> 00:00:58,657
Whichever way you walk, one of them

31
00:00:58,677 --> 00:00:59,418
breaks.

32
00:01:00,868 --> 00:01:02,109
You call Mira.

33
00:01:02,129 --> 00:01:03,029
Let me guess.

34
00:01:03,069 --> 00:01:03,710
Your mum.

35
00:01:03,730 --> 00:01:04,640
I'm sorry.

36
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:06,090
I promised her first.

37
00:01:06,110 --> 00:01:07,091
Then go.

38
00:01:07,241 --> 00:01:09,021
And Mira does something you didn't know

39
00:01:09,041 --> 00:01:10,346
was possible.

40
00:01:10,366 --> 00:01:12,121
She cuts her own string.

41
00:01:12,141 --> 00:01:12,916
Gently.

42
00:01:12,936 --> 00:01:14,177
So it doesn't snap.

43
00:01:14,197 --> 00:01:14,787
There.

44
00:01:14,807 --> 00:01:16,295
Now you didn't break anything.

45
00:01:16,845 --> 00:01:18,650
You spend Sunday with Mum.

46
00:01:18,670 --> 00:01:20,495
Her string turns gold.

47
00:01:20,515 --> 00:01:22,645
On Monday, you knock on Mira's door

48
00:01:22,665 --> 00:01:23,610
with pizza.

49
00:01:23,630 --> 00:01:24,720
Next Saturday.

50
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:25,500
Boxes.

51
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:26,411
Promise.

52
00:01:26,561 --> 00:01:28,756
She ties the new string herself.

53
00:01:28,776 --> 00:01:30,953
Who holds the thickest string to you?
